# FE Architecture Rule

Always follow `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

## Required structure

```text
src/
  app/
  shared/
  features/
  assets/
```

## Hard constraints

- This project is hybrid feature-first.
- `app/` is for composition only.
- `shared/` is for reusable infrastructure and primitives only.
- `features/` owns business workflows, pages, feature hooks, and route exports.
- `features/admin` exists structurally but is deferred.
- Do not introduce root-level `services/`, `pages/`, or `context/` as architecture primitives.

## Routing

- Each feature may export route objects or route arrays.
- `app/router/` only composes feature route exports and wrappers.
- Do not move feature page logic into `app/router/`.
